{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1414795-what-if-changelings-were-actually-shaped-mortal-souls","id":1414795,"title":"What if Changelings were actually shaped mortal souls?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-20T13:31:38-07:00","id":1414795,"title":"What if Changelings were actually shaped mortal souls?","content":"<span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">So I was pondering world of darkness stuff while listening to the Mage Podcast and doing rote functions at work. I had one idea pop into my head what if the Changeling Way wasn\u2019t Fae hiding in Mortals but what if it was actually True Fae shaped the souls of Mortals into True Fae Lite ^tm?</span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">So their memories are screwed but it\u2019s not like they were Fae in their memories of the past, or they could even be memories of their mortal lives encountering them Fae. And so the True Fae could actually be shaped from the stories of the Mortal who they shaped the soul of into nascent Changelings?</span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Not saying this is truth, but it would be interesting to explore in a game. Goes with the thought of the nature of Arcadia and the Fae aren\u2019t who we think they are. Hell the Sidhe might not even be the Firstborn they could even be the Changelings of the past making the Tuatha the Firstborn of Dark Ages.</span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Thoughts?</span><br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T13:35:42-07:00","id":1414797,"title":"","content":"Fascinating. I never thought of this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T13:41:10-07:00","id":1414799,"title":"","content":"Isn't that How Changling: the lost does it?<br /> <br /> Also the Arcadian card game hits at it <a href=\"https://arcadiaccg.wordpress.com/2018/07/20/dreaming-card-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">https://arcadiaccg.wordpress.com/201...ng-card-notes/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","user":"Konradleijon","date":". 09-20-2020, 04:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T13:51:00-07:00","id":1414802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1414795-what-if-changelings-were-actually-shaped-mortal-souls?p=1414799#post1414799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't that How Changling: the lost does it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Close, though I do have Lost Style Changeling appear as new wild card phenomena in my setting.<br /> <br /> The idea here is the Shattering was hitting the Fae Lords were retreating into the newly separated Dreaming and before they leave they make pacts and reshape mortal souls into the legends they inspired to sort of act as the stewards of the world, rather then take mortals as servants to Faery (which they did as well to create some of the Dark Age Changelings). This resulted in the orphaned changelings believing they were always Fae and feeling they were abandoned by their Lords. So a lot of their history is made up from communal myths and shared hallucinations/dreamt lies. The Sidhe could be the Returned Firstborn, the Previous Changelings of the Dark Ages who believe they were nobles forgetting their true origins, or even souls of spirited away Mortals or children of Fae born in the Dreaming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T14:57:33-07:00","id":1414821,"title":"","content":"So in your setting there are Lost style changelings distinct from the Dreaming style changelings?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T15:05:54-07:00","id":1414824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1414795-what-if-changelings-were-actually-shaped-mortal-souls?p=1414821#post1414821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So in your setting there are Lost style changelings distinct from the Dreaming style changelings?</div> </div> </div> </div>In my setting there are dreaming style Changelings with Lost style origins, so sometimes mortals become servants in the dreaming, becoming beings of Faery and sometimes have enough coherent ego/humanity to make their way back to Earth. I also played with the idea of Fetches made from the souls kicked by the Sidhe and Tithed to Arcadia, they come back to the Autumn world and have to make a Husk kind of like the Inanimae, and often appear as doppelg\u00e4ngers of the Sidhe\u2019s host. Since they aren\u2019t part of a Kith they have a more customizable mien and set of Birthrights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T18:41:30-07:00","id":1414853,"title":"","content":"Are you the author of the Changeling 5th Edition guide, Eldagusto? <br /> <br /> Would you share some more in-depth rules for Fetches you use?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T20:30:14-07:00","id":1414871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>valismedsen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1414795-what-if-changelings-were-actually-shaped-mortal-souls?p=1414853#post1414853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you the author of the Changeling 5th Edition guide, Eldagusto?<br /> <br /> Would you share some more in-depth rules for Fetches you use?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nono that was Charlie Cantrell my friend.<br /> <br /> But for Fetches I'm thinking of tying each of them to an Arcadian Sidhe. They return to the Autumn World one way or another, either escape or win their freedom or are even sent from Arcadia. Their time in Arcadia is magnified so they could have spent centuries there rather then the decades they were kicked out of their body in real time.<br /> <br /> They will return to the Autumn World as a Chimerical beings but they will share a fragment essence with the Sidhe, that might take the form of a scrape of their shadow, or true name, reflection, echo, or something ephemeral and they will use this fragment to guide them through dreaming to the Autumn World. They will then create a husk out of scraps of Nature (like sticks wrapped into a doll with grass twine), Flesh/Blood like a bundle of bloody teeth, or scraps of garbage like rags and cans made into a basic puppet. They will have a husk rating like the Inanimae but they wouldn't have an anchor. They would then choose from a set of customizable Birthrights, and a set of customizable echoes like with Dark Age Fae, they would basically be folklore banes for supernatural creatures so it could be being hurt by churchbells, or not being able to cross streams.<br /> <br /> they would then choose a favored Realm tied to the nature of what their husk was made out of and if they are slain their body returns to the state of what their husk was made of, so they collapse into a pile of autumn leaves, or bloody dog bones.<br /> <br /> Their body might look different to their Sidhe counterpart because they might have grown older in Arcadia, or even stayed younger depending on the nature of their stay.<br /> But they often feel driven to reclaim their body from the Sidhe, this has driven some to slay the Sidhe, but others have found a way to fuse with the Sidhe into a more complete form.<br /> <br /> I also have the Spirited Away Changelings, changelings who made deals with Arcadia and spend a century and a day there in indentured servitude before returning to the Autumn World with misty remembrance but also bound by barely remembered oaths to work towards the goals of their patrons. They would be similar to the Fetches but they would have their own body upon returning, you might treat them as being vulnerable to Banality like Arcadian Sidhe. I'm still torn between whether they might be treated like Arcadian Sidhe in needing to take a mortal body like the Sidhe did and thus sending a Tithed Soul which could return as a Fetch.<br /> <br /> <br /> They might even have a chosen favored Art where they maybe they add that Art rating to rolls in that Art, but if I do it that way it might mean the other Arts cost more to purchase.<br /> <br /> But the Spirited Away Changelings would give a weird impression of sort of protokiths, so some changeling might speculate if this was how the Kiths started ages ago but forgotten by the mists of History. They would also not necessarily be working for the Tuatha, many if not most of would have made deals with Fomorian Forces. Still working on how their Courts would work, they might actually use the Seasonal Courts, or the Courts of Dawn, Day, Dusk, and Night rather then Seelie/Unseelie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-21T05:11:26-07:00","id":1414900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1414795-what-if-changelings-were-actually-shaped-mortal-souls?p=1414824#post1414824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my setting there are dreaming style Changelings with Lost style origins, so sometimes mortals become servants in the dreaming, becoming beings of Faery and sometimes have enough coherent ego/humanity to make their way back to Earth. I also played with the idea of Fetches made from the souls kicked by the Sidhe and Tithed to Arcadia, they come back to the Autumn world and have to make a Husk kind of like the Inanimae, and often appear as doppelg\u00e4ngers of the Sidhe\u2019s host. Since they aren\u2019t part of a Kith they have a more customizable mien and set of Birthrights.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome. I wonder if like the Kithain and the Lost could have coexisted back during the Dark Ages? Before the Dreaming was fully formed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25665,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 09-21-2020, 08:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T07:32:19-07:00","id":1416255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1414795-what-if-changelings-were-actually-shaped-mortal-souls?p=1414900#post1414900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Awesome. I wonder if like the Kithain and the Lost could have coexisted back during the Dark Ages? Before the Dreaming was fully formed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Coexisted doesn't seem to be the right word.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T08:01:44-07:00","id":1416261,"title":"","content":"What would the right word be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T09:54:47-07:00","id":1416734,"title":"","content":"Uneasy truces at best, and full on warfare at worse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-05T00:17:37-07:00","id":1416810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1414795-what-if-changelings-were-actually-shaped-mortal-souls?p=1416734#post1416734\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Uneasy truces at best, and full on warfare at worse.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like that interpretation too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]}]}